{"symbol":"RIKHAV","yahoo":"RIKHAV.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Rikhav Securities Limited","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Capital Markets","website":"https://www.rikhav.net","about":"Rikhav Securities Limited operates as a managed shares and stocks broking company in India. It offers a range of capital market solutions across equity broking, derivatives, commodities, proprietary trading, market making, depository services, mutual fund distribution, IPO application services, and margin trading facility, as well as clearing services. The company also provides Rikhav Plus, a mobile trading platform to provide access to multiple asset classes through a single, intuitive interface; and Meon Aadhaar eKYC Platform, a streamlined digital onboarding. It serves institutional, high net-worth individuals (HNIs), and retail clients. The company was formerly known as Brijmohan Sagarmal Finance Limited and changed its name to Rikhav Securities Limited in February 2006. The company was incorporated in 1995 and is based in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-30T12:12:40+00:00","quote":{"price":48.1,"prevClose":52.0,"marketCap":184.18,"high52":77.5,"low52":34.0,"pe":10.51,"bookValue":64.11,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":8.03,"shares":3.8292,"insiders":70.03,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-01-22","2025-01-23","2025-01-24","2025-01-27","2025-01-28","2025-01-29","2025-01-30","2025-01-31","2025-02-03","2025-02-04","2025-02-05","2025-02-06","2025-02-07","2025-02-10","2025-02-11","2025-02-12","2025-02-13","2025-02-14","2025-02-17","2025-02-18","2025-02-19","2025-02-20","2025-02-21","2025-02-24","2025-02-25","2025-02-27","2025-02-28","2025-03-03","2025-03-04","2025-03-05","2025-03-06","2025-03-07","2025-03-10","2025-03-11","2025-03-12","2025-03-13","2025-03-17","2025-03-18","2025-03-19","2025-03-20","2025-03-21","2025-03-24","2025-03-25","2025-03-26","2025-03-27","2025-03-28","2025-04-01","2025-04-02","2025-04-03","2025-04-04","2025-04-07","2025-04-08","202